# The context is everything this image needs and nothing else: `*` excludes the whole module -
# src/, the Gradle build directory, the README - and each line below adds back one file the
# Dockerfile actually COPYs. That means a new COPY needs a line here, or the build fails with
# `failed to compute cache key: "/<file>": not found` and nothing points at this file. It happened
# on 2026-09-02: docker-entrypoint.sh was added to the Dockerfile on 2026-09-01 and not here, and
# the release workflow's image push was the first thing to notice.
*
!build/libs/*.jar
!docker-entrypoint.sh
